    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/38403/tosca_ee_visual__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Semi-staged production presented in Italian with English and French surtitles.\n\nMusic by Giacomo Puccini\nLibretto by Giuseppe Giacosa, Luigi Illica\n\nThree things to know:\n\n\n\tFilled with moments of intrigue, deception, and revenge, Tosca offers as much suspense as your favourite crime novel or film noir.\n\tThis semi-staged production reunites the creative team behind NAC Orchestra’s sold-out 2023 performances of Mozart’s Don Giovanni.\n\t Internationally acclaimed soprano Ailyn Pérez stars as Floria Tosca, the most famous opera singer in Rome.\n\n\nA tale of art, politics, and dangerous romance set..."
      }
    ],
